ai-catalog.normative.cddl combines the two normative CDDL code blocks from the
AI Catalog specification by the Agent Card Working Group, Agent-Card/ai-catalog
commit 9316f00de22f8baf0a7bb526cf92e27a40ca047e. The extraction removes only the
surrounding Markdown headings and code fences. Specification material is
CC-BY-4.0; see AI-CATALOG-LICENSE.md and
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.

ai-catalog.local.schema.json is a local JSON-compatible structural transcription
of that CDDL, created for this site. It is a modified derivative, not an official
upstream JSON Schema or a general CDDL validator. Additional site contracts and
semantic checks live in validate-discovery.py. It does not verify trust claims,
signatures, publisher authority or third-party client support.

Exact source URLs, commit/blob identifiers and local SHA-256 checksums are in
provenance.json. No schema or context is downloaded during validation.
